    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="59">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> 59</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif se goldfinger sie ofaslegen, to þam sculon XVII scill to bote; ⁊ his nægles IIII scill to bote.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If the ring finger175 is struck off, for that 17 shillings shall be compensation; and for its nail 4 shillings as compensation.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If the third finger is struck off, 17 shillings must be paid as compensation for it; and for the nail of the same, 4 shillings [must be paid] as compensation</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif se goldfinger bið ofaslægen, to ðæm sculon XVII scll' to bote; ⁊ his nægles IIII scll' to bote.</ab>
      </div>
